Step 1: Create and enter project folder
mkdir docker-html-program
cd docker-html-program

Step 2: Create index.html
nano index.html

Enter:
<html>
<body>
    <h1>Hello Docker Demonstration</h1>
    <p>This is My first Docker containerized web application.</p>
</body>
</html>

Save: Ctrl + O → Enter → Ctrl + X
Step 3: Check HTML file
cat index.html

Step 4: Create Dockerfile
nano Dockerfile

Enter:
FROM nginx
COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/

Save: Ctrl + O → Enter → Ctrl + X
Step 5: Build Docker image
docker build -t myhtml .

Step 6: Check Docker image
docker images

Step 7: Run Docker container
docker run -d -p 8080:80 myhtml

Step 8: Open the application
Open in browser:
http://localhost:8080

Step 9: Check running container
docker ps
